:"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-b94bca8a60e9d62b03e3"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-b94bca8a60e9d62b03e3","order":4787},{"id":"hechang-e-99a48563de4e29f5544e","title":"赵俨受书差千二百兵助汉中殷署督送","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-99a48563de4e29f5544e","label":"正文","text":"赵俨受书差千二百兵助汉中殷署督送","evidence":["hechang-q-f66c94ac2fb42eca40e4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0016","role":"差兵","evidence":["hechang-q-f66c94ac2fb42eca40e4"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0038","role":"督送","evidence":["hechang-q-f66c94ac2fb42eca40e4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-f66c94ac2fb42eca40e4"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-f66c94ac2fb42eca40e4","order":4788},{"id":"hechang-e-edece985fde7ef05d757","title":"赵俨斜谷慰军闻叛决定返回本营","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-edece985fde7ef05d757","label":"正文","text":"赵俨斜谷慰军闻叛决定返回本营","evidence":["hechang-q-a61be2c7ed269fbfd964"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0016","role":"慰军决返","evidence":["hechang-q-a61be2c7ed269fbfd964"]},{"person":"wgc-p0068","role":"劝阻返营","evidence":["hechang-q-a61be2c7ed269fbfd964"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0038","role":"所领军叛","evidence":["hechang-q-a61be2c7ed269fbfd964"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-a61be2c7ed269fbfd964"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-a61be2c7ed269fbfd964","order":4789}],"persons":[{"id":"zhangle-p0038","name":"殷署","evidence":["zhangle-q-o044","hechang-q-a61be2c7ed269fbfd964","hechang-q-6bcfce86d3a6285cff3e","hechang-q-b94bca8a60e9d62b03e3","hechang-q-f66c94ac2fb42eca40e4"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangle-m-o044-zhangle-p0038","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o044"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-6bcfce86d3a6285cff3e","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-05caaa981bbb22e01e90","layer":"original","quote":"太祖徙出故韩遂、马超等兵五千余人，使平难将军殷署等督领〖8〗；以俨为关中护军〖9〗，尽统诸军。羌虏数来寇害，俨率署等追到新平〖10〗，大破之。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":265,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-a61be2c7ed269fbfd964","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-24a94cd4b0f6d3e19a2a","layer":"original","quote":"署发后一日，俨虑其有变，乃自追至斜谷口，人人慰劳；又深戒署。还宿雍州刺史张既舍〖14〗，署军复前四十里；兵果叛乱，未知署吉凶。而俨自随步骑百五十人，皆与叛者同部曲，或婚姻；得此问〖15〗，各惊，被甲持兵，不复自安。俨欲还，既等以为：“今本营党已扰乱，一身赴之无益，可须定问〖16〗。”俨曰：“虽疑本营与叛者同谋，要当闻行者变〖17〗，乃发之。又有欲善不能自定〖18〗，宜及犹豫，促抚宁之。且为之元帅，既不能安辑〖19〗，身受祸难，命也。”","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":219,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-b94bca8a60e9d62b03e3","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-05caaa981bbb22e01e90","layer":"original","quote":"屯田客吕并自称“将军”〖11〗，聚党据陈仓，俨复率署等攻之，贼即破灭。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":265,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":71,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-f66c94ac2fb42eca40e4","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-05caaa981bbb22e01e90","layer":"original","quote":"时被书差千二百兵往助汉中守〖12〗，署督送之〖13〗。行者猝与室家别，皆有忧色。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":265,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":106,"end":146,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o044b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-c20aa407eaa949f0a2f7","layer":"original","quote":"贼屯偃城〖3〗。晃到，诡道作都堑〖4〗，示欲截其后；贼烧屯走。晃得偃城，两面连营；稍前，去贼围三丈所。未攻，太祖前后遣殷署、朱盖等，凡十二营，诣晃。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":100,"end":174,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o044","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-c20aa407eaa949f0a2f7","layer":"original","quote":"复遣晃助曹仁讨关羽，屯宛。会汉水暴溢，于禁等没。羽围仁于樊，又围将军吕常于襄阳。晃所将多新卒，以羽难与争锋，遂前，至阳陵陂屯〖1〗。太祖复还遣将军徐商、吕建等诣晃〖2〗，令曰：“须兵马集至，乃俱前。”贼屯偃城〖3〗。晃到，诡道作都堑〖4〗，示欲截其后；贼烧屯走。晃得偃城，两面连营；稍前，去贼围三丈所。未攻，太祖前后遣殷署、朱盖等，凡十二营，诣晃。贼围头有屯〖5〗，又别屯四冢〖6〗。晃扬声当攻围头屯，而密攻四冢。羽见四冢欲坏，自将步骑五千出战。晃击之，退走；遂追陷与俱入围，破之：或自投沔水死。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":248,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
